  "text_dump": "Logpom Pharmacy Building, Douala\nMon–Fri 8:00–18:00 · Sat 9:00–14:00\ncontact@fedpawa.com\nFEDPAWA\nCORPORATE SOLUTIONS\nHOME\nSERVICES ▾\nABOUT US\nCONTACT\nSIGN IN\nHOME\nDOMICILIATION\nCOMPANY FORMATION\nTAX & LEGAL ADVISORY\nOAPI PROTECTION\nCONTRACTS\nABOUT US\nCONTACT\nSUBSCRIBE\nFR\n×\nFEDPAWA CORPORATE SOLUTIONS SARL\nYour Business\nInfrastructure & Operational Hub\n\nA first-class business infrastructure in the heart of Douala, Logpom — for companies of every size.\n\nWhether you are a local entrepreneur, a growing SME or a multinational opening a subsidiary in Central Africa, we provide a registered office, mail management, a telephone secretariat and high-end offices — without the costs of a traditional commercial lease.\n\nDISCOVER OUR SERVICES\n→\nCONTACT US\nOUR EXPERTISE\nFive services, a single address\nSERVICE 01\n01\nDomiciliation for Legal Entities & Companies\n\nA prestigious professional address in Logpom, with mail scanning, forwarding and a personalized phone desk. Give your company a serious base without the costs of a physical office.\n\nRecognized business address\nMail scanning & forwarding\nPersonalized phone desk\nMeeting room on demand\nDISCOVER DOMICILIATION\n→\n01\nDOMICILIATION\n02\nFORMATION\n03\nTAX\n04\nOAPI\n05\nCONTRACTS\nWHY FEDPAWA\nThe Strategic Partner for Your Business\n\nFEDPAWA CORPORATE SOLUTIONS SARL provides every executive with a trusted ecosystem: an on-site team to secure your document flows, an interconnected telephone secretariat so you never miss a client, and exclusive access to high-end Executive offices.\n\nABOUT US\n→\nReady to Structure Your Company on Solid Foundations?\n\nContact us today for personalized guidance with our experts.\n\nSUBSCRIBE\nCONTACT US\nFEDPAWA\nCORPORATE SOLUTIONS\n\nA first-class business infrastructure in the heart of Douala, Logpom. Room to settle in, room to grow.\n\nFind Us\n\nLogpom Pharmacy Building, roadside, Logpom, Douala, Cameroon\n\nMonday–Friday 8:00 – 18:00\nSaturday 9:00 – 14:00\n\ncontact@fedpawa.com\n\nNavigation\nHome\nDomiciliation\nCompany Formation\nTax & Legal Advisory\nOAPI Protection\nContracts\nContact\nLegal Information\n\nRC: to be completed\nIFU: to be completed\nCNPS: to be completed\n\n© 2026 FEDPAWA CORPORATE SOLUTIONS. All rights reserved.\nDouala · Logpom · Cameroon",
